509 0 obj
<<
/Title (Visual reasoning: The contour is positioned along the apparent inner cavity boundary and excludes the surrounding wall. The basal closure is visible. The image quality makes the exact basal endocardial edge less sharply defined than in an ideal study, so this example should be treated as visually consistent rather than quantitatively proven.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 481 0 R
/Prev 508 0 R
>>
